  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nMean = Mode, x ((f₁ - f₀)/(2f₁ - f₀ - f₂)) × h\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nΣf = 16 + x\n\nΣfᵢxᵢ = (6 × 20) + (10 × 30) + (x × 40) = 420 + 40x\n\n⇒ Mean = (420 + 40x)/(16 + x)\n\nModal class = 25-35 (Since x (10 - 6)/(2(10) - 6 - x) × 10\n\n⇒ Mode = 25 + (40)/(14 - x)\n\nMean = Mode\n\n⇒ (420 + 40x)/(16 + x) = 25 + (40)/(14 - x)\n\n⇒ (420 + 40x)/(16 + x) = (390 - 25x)/(14 - x)\n\n⇒ (420 + 40x)(14 - x) = (390 - 25x)(16 + x)\n\n⇒ 5880 + 140x - 40x² = 6240 - 10x - 25x²\n\n⇒ 15x² - 150x + 360 = 0\n\n⇒ x² - 10x + 24 = 0\n\n⇒ (x - 4)(x - 6) = 0\n\n⇒ x = 4 or x = 6\n\n⇒ x = 4 (Since x < 6)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (3).**",
